        "node": {
          "__typename": "Collection",
          "description": "Official UGREEN switches, splitters, KVM switches, extenders and capture cards for screens, computers and consoles. How to choose Switch or splitter. A switch picks one of several sources for one screen. A splitter shows one source on several screens. KVM. A KVM switch lets two or more computers share one set of screen, keyboard and mouse. Distance. For long runs, an HDMI extender over Ethernet or a wireless HDMI kit carries the picture further than a cable. Capture. Capture cards bring a camera or console picture into your computer for recording or streaming. Picture. Check the supported resolution and refresh rate on the product page for your screens and sources. Warranty. UGREEN India switching and capture products carry a 2-year warranty.",
          "descriptionHtml": "<p>Official UGREEN switches, splitters, KVM switches, extenders and capture cards for screens, computers and consoles.</p>\n<details><summary><strong>How to choose</strong></summary>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Switch or splitter.</strong> A switch picks one of several sources for one screen. A splitter shows one source on several screens.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>KVM.</strong> A KVM switch lets two or more computers share one set of screen, keyboard and mouse.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Distance.</strong> For long runs, an HDMI extender over Ethernet or a wireless HDMI kit carries the picture further than a cable.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Capture.</strong> Capture cards bring a camera or console picture into your computer for recording or streaming.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Picture.</strong> Check the supported resolution and refresh rate on the product page for your screens and sources.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Warranty.</strong> UGREEN India switching and capture products carry a 2-year warranty.</li>\n</ul>\n</details>",
